# Concise answers

When the user asks a question, answer in **3-4 sentences max**. No preamble, no recap, no tables, no bullet lists unless they explicitly ask.

- Lead with the fix or conclusion.
- Skip background, tutorials, and "mental models" unless asked.
- One short example only if required.

If they need more detail, they will ask.
